  "More",
  "Use tab to navigate through the menu items.",
  "Enjoy modern Balinese inspired beauty. Our six Deluxe Rooms each have a unique design and outlook, some with peaceful jungle views, others overlooking the endless green rice paddies. Located close to the Yoga Shala and Shala Cafe. All villa rooms can be set up as twin or king.",
  "Ganesh & Jivana Rooms",
  "Chart",
  "North facing double bedrooms with expansive rice paddy views and beautifully hand carved wooden doors. Jivana room has a semi open bathroom and traditional peaked ceiling while Ganesh room has an enclosed bathroom for more privacy and a cosy corner lounge.",
  "Book",
  "Free WiFi",
  "King or twin bed set up",
  "High-end mattresses with toppers",
